WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:01.190
Hello.

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:04.950
Services and prices are the first thing customers look at when they

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.270
book.

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:09.430
In this lesson, I'll show you how to add a service to your salon,

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:14.150
its name, how long it takes, the price, and who performs it.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:17.190
Customers see exactly that when they book online.

00:00:18.116 --> 00:00:19.126
In your dashboard.

00:00:19.076 --> 00:00:20.806
Tap services in the menu.

00:00:21.316 --> 00:00:25.526
Here is your salon's whole service menu with prices and durations.

00:00:26.196 --> 00:00:28.486
To add a new one Tap Add service.

00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:30.418
A form opens

00:00:31.168 --> 00:00:33.618
under Basics, enter the service name.

00:00:33.568 --> 00:00:35.698
For example French Manicure

00:00:36.128 --> 00:00:37.458
Choose a service group.

00:00:37.408 --> 00:00:41.698
If you sort your menu into groups and write a short description,

00:00:42.128 --> 00:00:45.418
it appears right under the service name when a customer picks it.

00:00:46.054 --> 00:00:47.464
Next time and price.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:53.304
Tap a duration, for example 45 minutes or type any number of minutes.

00:00:53.974 --> 00:00:57.304
Cleanup time after is the break between two customers.

00:00:57.734 --> 00:01:00.424
Choose the currency, then enter the price.

00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:04.744
If you want customers to pay a deposit, fill in deposit too.

00:01:05.334 --> 00:01:08.904
The Golden Line below shows exactly what customers will see.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:11.060
Then who performs it.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:14.180
Tap the staff members who can do this service.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:16.100
Or tap select all

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:19.620
when you're done, tap save at the bottom.

00:01:20.311 --> 00:01:22.841
The new service appears in the list straight away.

00:01:23.751 --> 00:01:25.721
Each service has its buttons

00:01:26.151 --> 00:01:29.081
Edit duplicate to quickly create a similar one,

00:01:29.431 --> 00:01:32.321
Add ons to attach extras and hide.

00:01:32.271 --> 00:01:33.321
When you pause it,

00:01:33.991 --> 00:01:37.321
you can also drag the handle on the left to change the order.

00:01:38.151 --> 00:01:39.401
Now take the quiz below.
